---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT * FROM (SELECT a, 's' AS k FROM t UNION SELECT a, 'u' AS k FROM u UNION SELECT a, 's' AS k FROM u) x WHERE k = 's'"
---
Aggregate [a#0, k#3], [a#0, k#3]
+- Union
   :- Aggregate [a#0, k#3], [a#0, k#3]
   :  +- Project [a#0, 's' AS k#3]
   :     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
   +- Project [a#4, 's' AS k#7]
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#4]
